          <strong>Paket Website Utama E-Commerce (Storefront &amp; Katalog)</strong>
          <ul style="margin: 4pt 0 2pt 0; padding-left: 18pt;">
            <li>Desain web modern <em>Fresh &amp; Clean Minimalist</em> responsif HP &amp; Desktop</li>
            <li>Halaman Katalog dengan Hero Banner Carousel, filter &amp; pencarian</li>
            <li>Halaman New Drop Collection, Collections, dan Profil Usaha (/about)</li>
            <li>Halaman Detail Produk multi-foto, varian ukuran, &amp; ulasan pembeli</li>
          </ul>
        </td>
        <td>Rp. 2.500.000</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td style="text-align: center;">2</td>
        <td>
          <strong>Paket Sistem Belanja, Akun Pelanggan &amp; Checkout</strong>
          <ul style="margin: 4pt 0 2pt 0; padding-left: 18pt;">
            <li>Keranjang Belanja Geser (<em>Cart Drawer</em>) &amp; indikator gratis ongkir</li>
            <li>Registrasi &amp; Login Email serta tombol Login Google (OAuth 2.0)</li>
            <li>Halaman Profil, Ubah Password, &amp; Riwayat Pesanan pelanggan</li>
            <li>Buku Alamat <em>Multi-Address</em> (maks. 5 alamat &amp; Alamat Utama)</li>
            <li>Halaman Checkout, kalkulasi ongkir zona, &amp; opsi metode pembayaran</li>
          </ul>
        </td>
        <td>Rp. 2.500.000</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td style="text-align: center;">3</td>
        <td>
          <strong>Paket Dashboard Admin &amp; Manajemen Toko</strong>
          <ul style="margin: 4pt 0 2pt 0; padding-left: 18pt;">
            <li>Dashboard statistik penjualan &amp; ringkasan pesanan</li>
            <li>Manajemen CRUD produk pakaian, upload multi-foto &amp; stok per ukuran</li>
            <li>Manajemen banner promosi halaman depan</li>
            <li>Manajemen status pengiriman pesanan &amp; input nomor resi</li>
            <li>Setup database PostgreSQL, proteksi keamanan, &amp; deploy awal ke VPS</li>
          </ul>
        </td>
        <td>Rp. 2.000.000</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td colspan="2" style="text-align: center; font-weight: bold;">Total</td>
        <td style="font-weight: bold;">Rp. 7.000.000</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
